  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "1.3.0 — tracks PostQuantum.FileEncryption 1.3.0 in lockstep (the library now multi-targets net8.0 and net10.0; the tool itself still runs on the .NET 10 runtime or later). New: pqfe keygen / sign / verify produce and check detached Ed25519 + ML-DSA-65 hybrid signatures via the new PostQuantum.FileEncryption.Signing package. No format change: the .pqfe v2 container format remains FROZEN for the 1.x line. See CHANGELOG.md.",
